<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1)unaudited consolidated financial results have been reviewed by Audit Committee&amp;thereafter approved&amp;taken on record by Board of Directors in their meeting held on August 14,2019.These unaudited consolidated financial results have been prepared in accordance with Indian Accounting Standards( Ind-AS )as specified under Section 133 of the Companies Act, 2013 read with the Rule 3 of Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) Rules, 2015&amp;Companies (Indian Accounting Standards)Amendment Rules,2016&amp;provisions of Companies Act, 2013.  n2) Statutory Auditors of Company have conducted a limited review of above consolidated financial result of Company for quarter ended June 30, 2019.An unqualified report has been issued by them thereon.3) Key Standalone Financial Information:Particulars Quarter endedYear Ended 30-Jun-19(Unaudited31-Mar-19(audited) 30-Jun-18(unaudited) 31-Mar-19(audited) Revenue from operationS 5,781.38, 3682.91,575.8.7153.54 Net profit before TaX 688.97, 97.27, 29.67,283.40 Net profit after TaX 478.97 t63.58 27.71, 187.57   n4)Company has entered into a Definitive Sale Agreement on Jan 21, 2019 with Tirumala Milk Products Private Limited ( The Buyer ) to sell the entire dairy business of Prabhat Dairy Ltd.vide a Business Transfer Agreement (BTA)&amp; sale of its subsidiary Sunfresh Agro Industries Pvt. ltd. by way of a slump sale on a going concern basis for a total consideration of Rs. 1,70,000 Lakhs (excluding adjustment for net debt outstanding &amp;working capital adjustment as agreed with the buyer). Aforesaid sale was subject to certain conditions precedent viz CCI,Shareholders, Bankers etc. During previous quarter,Company received all critical approvals&amp; post completing conditions precedent to the deal, the transaction was closed on April 2,2019.Company has classified all its assets &amp; liabilities of the dairy business as Held for sale w.e.f. January 21,2019 as perrequirements of Ind AS105 - Non-current Assets Held for Sale and Discontinued Operations.Similarly,Company has also re-classified results from discontinuing operations separately from the results from Continuing operations as per requirements of IND AS 105.Post completion of necessary formalities,purchase consideration has been received by Company in the designated Escrow Acc. on April 10, 2019. Net debt &amp;transaction costs have been settled from stated escrow account.As working capital adjustments&amp;other subsequent processes post-closing of transactions are not yet over,effect of above mentioned transaction was not given in Profit&amp;Loss statement for this quarter.Post sale of dairy business,Company intends to focus on the business of animal feeds &amp; nutrition5)On Feb13 2019,Board of directors approved scheme of Amalgamation &amp; arrangement under Section 230-233 of Companies Act,2013 (“Proposed Scheme”) for merger of Cheese Land Agro (India) Pvt.Ltd.,wholly owned subsidiary,with Company subject to approvals like shareholders approval,creditor approval,The Regional Directorate approval etc. as required. Since the approval of Regional Directorate was not received till the date of approval of financial results by the Board of Directors,merger has not been given effect to in the financial results of the Company.6)Effective April 1, 2018,Company has adopted IND AS 115 using the modified retrospective method as suggested in para C7 of transition provision of IND AS 115.Certain expenses in nature of variable consideration in a contract for sale of goods have been reclassified to revenue in the unaudited result for quarter&amp;year ended March 31,2019 &amp;therefore revenue for quarter&amp;year ended March 31,2019 may not be comparable to that extent.Adoption of the standard did not have any material impact on the results of the Company.7) Previous period's figures have been regrouped/ reclassified wherever necessary to correspond with the current period's classification/ disclosure.  n</in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
